      "@id": "sdc4:mc-v8jgjo2sml12jo7zrb8swoxi",
      "label": "Surname (Person)",
      "description": "The surname or family name of a person, part of a naming scheme for individuals, used in many cultures worldwide\naka: last name, fam name, family surname, surname, clan name",
